VAKE — license status

No distribution license is granted by this file. The supplied source snapshot
contains reused formal and engineering components whose authoritative copyright
and license notices have not been confirmed, and it does not establish a license
for the complete package.

The maintainers must supply the applicable notices and confirm the license for
all components before distributing the package under a stated license. Renaming
modules or rewriting documentation does not change copyright ownership or grant
additional rights.

The current component inventory is in docs/components.json.
